TEST start_workflow_success

RECEIVE HTTP:POST /start
WITH {{payloads/start_workflow_http_req.json}}

EXPECT GRPC:workflow.v1.WorkflowService/StartWorkflow
WITH {{payloads/start_workflow_request.yaml}}
RETURNS {{payloads/start_workflow_response.json}}

RESPOND HTTP:200
WITH {{payloads/start_workflow_http_resp.json}}
